                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "「むむ、君もなかなか筋がいいじゃないか」",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
